      "content": "thanks for the warning but i feel like i know my body. im not talking like crazy amounts, just a small boost to get the ritalin working better. i feel like most people do this anyway. its not like i'm taking tons of pills, just a little extra focus. if i just stick to like 2 or 3 energy drinks throughout the day it's probably fine right? it'll help me stay awake and focused for my exams.",
